        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Virgo &mdash; 1st (Signature) Technique, gained at level 1.</em></p><p><em>Treasure of Heaven. You decide what this creature is permitted to perceive.</em></p><p>The target must attempt a Will save.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> It loses one sense of your choice for 1 minute: sight (blinded), hearing (deafened), or smell and taste.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> Two senses.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The range increases by 10 feet. At 12th and 16th level, you may target one additional creature.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
